  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-learns-to-swim-v4.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "fc5ae2044c733b259ebd49ee92781bf54f1926307dab281a20734a31099145dd",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "93fd6faf2e3b092e8e4e2c2ca9ea2a05d9c06dd376478883886ee32000d98024",
      "text": "Wukong Learns\nto Swim",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0590d5170acd5bdb218259c2641136eadf649365babbb05eb2e85df30aa4551c",
      "text": "Ao Bing swims beside the\ncoach.\n“I want to swim, too!” says\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6dc862de2b4b5d96fbb983bfe8d0c3482c689b4c1ea79249dd9e9fd2537a5ef8",
      "text": "Wukong stops at the edge.\n“I feel a little scared.”\n“We can go slowly,” says the\ncoach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d7048012882923d340dd6f1cc01e29b696470db5f372a267c1b84a80f31b2d62",
      "text": "Sandy sits close to the pool.\nThe coach holds out a hand.\n“Ready?” Wukong nods.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "82cf167f414fac4bd67b03c258efe26d5546a99f05a0e5c846419f294c236b45",
      "text": "Wukong holds the pool edge.\nThe coach stays right beside\nhim.\nAo Bing makes a tiny splash.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "38f43be5baa144f042f663eefcd6255983fbb367c582cc928c8d157ef65bf66f",
      "text": "Three toys bob in the pool.\nA shark, a starfish, a\nclownfish!\n“Hello, little fish!” says\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3ab461628d6c7a6e3bc463d15fc1033db6c5285768d3defbd378b0addc7ef85a",
      "text": "The coach lifts a foam\nbarbell.\nIt has big blue ends.\n“Do fish lift weights?” asks\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7f175f8566be6e4e47aeed5755920bf74e246282aa2aae6e82ba4516f16bd781",
      "text": "“This one helps us practice.”\nWukong grins, but holds the\nedge.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b8bf446a657fa9b92d7da6d814d6a33c9775d939d71f3e1f421a93ac4b70969d",
      "text": "The coach blows little\nbubbles.\nWukong tries to blow bubbles,\ntoo.\nPop, pop, pop!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "47cc0b1191e8f00c26090e9249a4755dd5698ce773cbbc9ddf424b193e5db6ea",
      "text": "Water tickles his chin.\nHe lifts his face and blinks.\n“A little rest,” says the\ncoach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e9f4e11107db44eeac296f644b75b730dda63cb8e19643b848ddd81b618b236a",
      "text": "Wukong comes back for\nanother lesson.\nHe makes more bubbles at the\nedge.\n“My bubbles are back!” he\nsays.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ccd1fc9b5393c8eeb598f7416988b2b1a9157e344c5ef245a8ed24de02525cc9",
      "text": "“Can you help me float?”\n“Yes,” says the coach.\n“I am holding you.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "28114f3b630b30c4cab0856dd0bebee949bbf83f6e67f89e18b24c23daf2e3ea",
      "text": "Wukong starts to float with\nhelp.\nHis belly bobs like a boat.\n“A boat with a tail!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "13d97f12fffccd7b2b7cbbd6b8385654550a360245e42cf41b5373b51f6efbe4",
      "text": "At another lesson, Wukong\ntries little kicks.\n“Legs straight. Knees soft.”\nWukong stretches his legs\nbehind him.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c2bdb57722376010086764eb48838cbc17c18c043a191d9c0901a483f66af7be",
      "text": "“Soft knees. Little kicks.”\nHis feet make small splashes.\n“The shark is watching!” says\nAo Bing.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "12614a8aedc4b15e85a527250154ee1117d7c44b08af3ddf6b4bf0e4ff89c7f9",
      "text": "Wukong holds the foam\nbarbell. “Head down. Look\ninto the water.” He blows\nbubbles and kicks. The coach\nsupports him.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5237e01d1fbec945389065e23de7b67d564eb058fcfe215164d77d17badda1a7",
      "text": "More lessons.\nHe puts the barbell down.\n“You are right here?”\n“Right here,” says the coach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2448574ebeca5d57b3874cd28f80c2f036c6796d2e43d8207dc36288ee0a0377",
      "text": "He swims a little way.\nThe coach stays within reach.\nWukong turns to hold the pool\nedge.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5e10d34b907c4d70aabca9c70bd975d0e2352340168969ed85b98a641b6c22cf",
      "text": "“I swam a little way!” says\nWukong.\n“You did!” says Ao Bing.\nThe coach helps Wukong out.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c0a1b215fb1c9f30bcafb4ecab1bfc6ddb4a36c0926439be0c02d119cf77d52f",
      "text": "Three toys go in the basket.\n“Good night, little shark.”\n“You had a busy lesson, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
